er-radius: 0 7px 5px 0; transform: skewY(10deg); }\n    .chair .seat {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 108px;\n      left: 33px;\n      width: 185px;\n      height: 31px;\n      border: 3px solid #221d18;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .chair .seat:after {\n      content: \"〰 〰 〰\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 34px;\n      top: 0;\n      font-size: 25px;\n      line-height: 20px;\n    }\n    .chair .leg-left, .chair .leg-right {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 134px;\n      width: 21px;\n      height: 129px;\n      border: 3px solid #221d18;\n    }\n    .chair .leg-left { left: 43px; border-top: 0; }\n    .chair .leg-right { right: 43px; border-top: 0; }\n    .chair .front-left, .chair .front-right {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 139px;\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 123px;\n      border: 3px solid #221d18;\n    }\n    .chair .front-left { left: 60px; border-top: 0; }\n    .chair .front-right { right: 60px; border-top: 0; }\n    .chair .rail {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 58px;\n      width: 135px;\n      border-top: 3px solid #221d18;\n    }\n    .chair .rail.one { top: 175px; }\n    .chair .rail.two { top: 222px; }\n    .chair .rail.three { top: 240px; left: 75px; width: 101px; transform: skewY(-21deg); }\n    .label {\n      position: absolute;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .line {\n      position: absolute;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #201b16;\n      transform-origin: left center;\n    }\n    .l-jing { left: 134px; top: 0; }\n    .l-jing .line { width: 23px; left: 34px; top: 10px; transform: rotate(90deg); }\n    .l-hua { left: 236px; top: 67px; }\n    .l-hua .line { width: 32px; left: 23px; top: 7px; transform: rotate(90deg); }\n    .l-sun { right: 15px; top: 112px; }\n    .l-sun .line { width: 34px; right: 48px; top: 8px; transform: rotate(180deg); }\n    .l-ka { left: 57px; top: 185px; }\n    .l-ka .line { width: 47px; left: 41px; top: 8px; }\n    .l-heng { right: 18px; top: 209px; }\n    .l-heng .line { width: 46px; right: 39px; top: 8px; transform: rotate(180deg); }\n    .l-tui { right: 20px; top: 380px; }\n    .l-tui .line { width: 35px; right: 31px; top: 8px; transform: rotate(180deg); }\n    .l-zu { left: 118px; top: 429px; }\n    .side-left {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 267px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 111px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .side-right {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 314px;\n      right: 0;\n      width: 108px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.16;\n      text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .bottom {\n      margin-top: 0;\n      padding-left: 117px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.18;\n      text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .bottom p { margin: 0 0 7px; }\n    .source {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: 3px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <span class=\"from\">From:</span>\n      <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"author\">清华博士的古家具美学</span>\n      <span class=\"red\">小红书</span>\n      <span class=\"series\">中国古典家具图文分析⑦</span>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"title\">玫瑰椅<span>图文分析</span></div>\n\n      <section class=\"top-copy\">\n        低于一般椅背，背高处与扶手高度相差无几，扶手弯曲呈弧。此椅因其后背较矮，在居室中陈设较灵活，适合临窗谈时不致高出窗台沿而阻碍视线。因用材单细轻巧，便于搬动，摆法灵活，所占空间亦不多，常设座椅。\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"diagram-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: centered Chinese rose chair line drawing]\">[Diagram: centered Chinese rose chair line drawing]</div>\n        <div class=\"chair\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"back\"></div>\n          <div class=\"panel\"></div>\n          <div class=\"motif\"></div>\n          <div class=\"arm-left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"arm-right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"seat\"></div>\n          <div class=\"leg-left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"leg-right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"front-left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"front-right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"rail one\"></div>\n          <div class=\"rail two\"></div>\n          <div class=\"rail three\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"label l-jing\">椅背<div class=\"line\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"label l-hua\">透雕花饰<div class=\"line\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"label l-sun\">靠头榫<div class=\"line\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"label l-ka\">卡子花<div class=\"line\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"label l-heng\">横枨<div class=\"line\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"label l-tui\">腿足<div class=\"line\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"label l-zu\">腿足</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <aside class=\"side-left\">\n        明清家具部件名称，外观雕花的花饰件，是卡在两条横枨之间的花饰。多用在“矮老”的位置，实质是装饰化了的横枨。多数是用木材镂雕纹样，也有用嵌玉卡子花等其他材料，常用的有双环卡子花、单环卡子花、板叶卡子花等。\n      </aside>\n\n      <aside class=\"side-right\">\n        明时玫瑰椅多圆腿或方腿，而清式腿通常用剑条线，串档间高，两旁斜有小方材与全钩剑条交接。〈鲁班经〉有“剑条镂”。 \n      </aside>\n\n      <section class=\"bottom\">\n        <p>使用雕刻手段装饰家具，最早见于战国。经过两千多年的发展和积累，到明清时期已经非常成熟。明清家具的雕刻手法主要有浮雕、透雕和圆雕。透雕是留出纹样，将底子镂空和全部花掉，使纹样镂空突出，留出图案还要做成立体效果。透雕可以两面雕，也可以只作一面雕。明式家具小面积的雕、线、刻、嵌手法中，刀法干稳，有力准确，小巧别致。明式家具上打板多用浮雕。偶尔用透雕。清式家具广泛使用透雕装饰方法。喜欢在椅子背板、案条牙条、挡板等部位采用装透雕，突出雕、空灵的效果。至清中期以后，雕饰达到了高潮，有时一件家具竟然通体满雕。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"source\">资料来自：《良工匠意》袁荃、张曦，百花文艺出版社，2016年1月</div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
